  "body": "**What.** Run the two #231 M 40 circles that #257 couldn't evaluate on the Mac, which has no M 40 build: D 55.04 at 0.061 + 3.853i and D 61.03 at 2.007 + 0.973i, under #257's alias rule. Recommended in #257's summary (its task 1).\n\n**Why.** All other circles are unchanged under the rule. These two need new determinants at M 40.\n\n**Acceptance (can fail).** Each winding is unchanged or corrected, with the \u03bb_phys control at each D.\n\n**Depends on.** #257, #231.\n",
