   "body": "Coordinator: for macm3, on a free thread. Pull main first (the circle tool has the alias rule from 14ddb64). Raw folder `I269-macm3/`. Copy the M 40 evals caches and results from `I231-macm3/D55_M40/data` and the D 61 M 40 data folder into `I269-macm3/D55/data` and `I269-macm3/D61/data`, the evals files only. Then rerun the two circles with the same centre, R and n0 as in #231, plus the \u03bb_phys circle at each D, on the M 40 states with `--M=40 --kf=23 --fmax=1e-15` and #231`s tags. Report each winding as unchanged or corrected.",
